1
00:00:00,801 --> 00:00:02,871
(Sheldon:)You're welcome.

2
00:00:02,869 --> 00:00:04,999
(Amy:)Do you realize
what's happening here?

3
00:00:05,005 --> 00:00:06,575
(Howard:)Yeah, I do.

4
00:00:06,573 --> 00:00:09,273
(Sheldon:)They're filling up on bread
and ruining their meal.

5
00:00:12,813 --> 00:00:13,843
(Leonard:)Hey.
AMY: Hey.

6
00:00:13,847 --> 00:00:15,417
(Amy:)What took you guys so long?

7
00:00:15,415 --> 00:00:17,585
(Leonard:)Oh, we were following Howard,
but for some reason,

8
00:00:17,584 --> 00:00:20,254
(Leonard:)he turned off his headlights
and went up a one-way street.

9
00:00:21,822 --> 00:00:23,392
(Penny:)So, what did we miss?

10
00:00:23,390 --> 00:00:25,490
(Alfred:)Oh, just Mary and I getting
to know each other a little.

11
00:00:25,492 --> 00:00:27,792
(Mary:)Leonard, your father
is just charming.

12
00:00:27,794 --> 00:00:28,824
(Beverly:)He's also broke.

13
00:00:28,829 --> 00:00:30,259
(Beverly:)Did he mention that?

14
00:00:32,499 --> 00:00:35,569
(Leonard:)Okay, Mom,
you sit over there...

15
00:00:37,004 --> 00:00:39,374
And I'm gonna call Bernadette
and see what's keeping them.

16
00:00:40,774 --> 00:00:42,474
(Sheldon:)If I'd known you were broke,

17
00:00:42,476 --> 00:00:44,746
(Sheldon:)I wouldn't have made
a big deal about the bread.

18
00:00:49,816 --> 00:00:51,246
(Bernadette(on phone):)Hey, Penny.

19
00:00:52,252 --> 00:00:53,752
(Bernadette(on phone):)What are you talking about?

20
00:00:55,989 --> 00:00:58,089
(Bernadette(on phone):)Oh, that was you?

21
00:00:58,091 --> 00:00:59,591
(chuckles)

